## One important IP precaution

Before filing a trademark application, conduct a proper clearance search covering at minimum the **USPTO, WIPO Global Brand Database, UKIPO and potentially EUIPO**, plus software products, domains, app stores, GitHub, package registries and common-law commercial use.

A normal web search is **not** sufficient trademark clearance. That is particularly important for software because identical or confusingly similar marks may exist in adjacent communications, streaming, cloud or SaaS categories without ranking prominently in web searches.

I would therefore treat all the names above as **candidate marks**, not as confirmation of registrability.

